# Scratch run logs.
#
# The debugging workflow here is `node verify.mjs > out.txt` and then reading the
# file, because the suite prints ~830 lines and terminal output gets truncated.
# Sixteen of these had accumulated in the root and been committed before anyone
# noticed. None of them belong in the history.
*.txt
*.log

# node_modules is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# It is committed so a clone runs offline with nothing to install, which is the
# whole reason three.js is served from disk rather than a CDN. Adding it here
# would not untrack what is already tracked, but it would silently drop any file
# added by a future `npm install`. See the README.

# OS and editor cruft.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
